{"t":"Green Mushroom","s":"green-mushroom-c9a1a","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Green_Mushroom_bf7f10.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Green Mushroom</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Green Mushroom\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Mushroom_bf7f10.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a><br/>Mushrooms</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.10 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">60 seconds<br/><small>(5% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210713190647&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Mushroom_bf7f10.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a green mushroom.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.10 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Munch.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Green mushrooms have decent regeneration per ounce (600s/oz), but they are far inferior to store-bought <a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\">Brown Mushrooms</a>. For the amount green mushrooms sell, you could buy 2640 seconds of regeneration from brown mushrooms (vs. 60 from green mushrooms). In addition to the cost inefficiency, their regeneration per oz is lower than half of brown mushrooms': 600s/oz vs. 1320s/oz. In this way, one could think of green mushrooms to be compared to creature products: they weigh next to nothing, sell high, and are stackable. It is not recommended to use these as a source of food unless it is the only food available.\n<br/>\n</p><p>Can be found at daily spawns around <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>. There's one here and there's also one right next to the tree which you open to get the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a>.\nOne green mushroom is required during a mission for <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">The Shattered Isles Quest</a> to gain access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Talahu\">Talahu</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Albino%20Dragon\">Albino Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepworm\">Deepworm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demodras\">Demodras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dreadbeast\">Dreadbeast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Bat\">Exotic Bat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Anemone\">Glooth Anemone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Servant\">Golden Servant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Servant%20Replica\">Golden Servant Replica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grimeleech\">Grimeleech</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch\">Ice Witch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Rat\">Mutated Rat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pixie\">Pixie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ribstride\">Ribstride</a></li